<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uk">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .header { background: #1a2744; padding: 28px 32px; }
    .header h1 { color: white; margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
    .header span { color: #f97316; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #334155; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #f97316; color: white; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 16px 0; }
    .info-box { background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .info-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .label { color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; }
    .value { font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Auto<span>Service</span></h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      {{{body}}}
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      © {{year}} AutoService. Усі права захищені.<br>
      Цей лист надіслано автоматично — не відповідайте на нього.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
